This license covers the original source code of Quran Reader (the Enyo/
JavaScript app under com.magq.quranreader/source/, index.html, appinfo.json,
depends.js, style.css, and the build tools under tools/). It does NOT cover:

  - The bundled Quran text and translations (Tanzil Uthmani text, the Talal
    Itani and Marmaduke Pickthall translations) - see CREDITS.txt and
    data/NOTICE.txt for their own licenses and terms.
  - The Amiri Quran font and the "Quran Shaped" font derived from it
    (com.magq.quranreader/fonts/) - licensed under the SIL Open Font
    License 1.1, see fonts/OFL.txt.
  - source/Updater-Helper.js, a modified copy of a third party's MIT-licensed
    file - see licenses/webos-common-MIT.txt.

Each of those keeps its own license regardless of this file.
